# The inputs of packaging/tmux/build.sh, pinned. One source per line:
#
#   <sha256>  <file name>  <url>
#
# build.sh checks every tarball against its hash before unpacking it, on every
# run, and its cache key is the hash of this file: changing a line here is how
# a version moves, and it rebuilds everything. A component is identified by its
# file name's leading word, so each of tmux, libevent, ncurses, utf8proc and
# jemalloc appears exactly once.
#
# Every hash was computed from the downloaded file itself, over HTTPS from the
# project's own release page or the GNU mirror (the ncurses tarball is
# byte-identical on invisible-island.net, its upstream).
7c60cae9a0e25288e2e24750aafc9e8800fc7fd4555e447e1b29ee4201cfb3bf  tmux-3.7c.tar.gz  https://github.com/tmux/tmux/releases/download/3.7c/tmux-3.7c.tar.gz
92e6de1be9ec176428fd2367677e61ceffc2ee1cb119035037a27d346b0403bb  libevent-2.1.12-stable.tar.gz  https://github.com/libevent/libevent/releases/download/release-2.1.12-stable/libevent-2.1.12-stable.tar.gz
136d91bc269a9a5785e5f9e980bc76ab57428f604ce3e5a5a90cebc767971cc6  ncurses-6.5.tar.gz  https://ftp.gnu.org/gnu/ncurses/ncurses-6.5.tar.gz
a393fbef160835fb315bc3e91ba8d86f7a73a7cec9e6198b6c60b848b498bfeb  utf8proc-2.12.0.tar.gz  https://github.com/JuliaStrings/utf8proc/releases/download/v2.12.0/utf8proc-2.12.0.tar.gz
2db82d1e7119df3e71b7640219b6dfe84789bc0537983c3b7ac4f7189aecfeaa  jemalloc-5.3.0.tar.bz2  https://github.com/jemalloc/jemalloc/releases/download/5.3.0/jemalloc-5.3.0.tar.bz2
